<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>tAlly⁺ • Privacy Policy, Terms of Service & Medical Notice</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 96 96'%3E%3Crect width='96' height='96' rx='22' fill='%2316171a'/%3E%3Ctext x='44' y='72' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia, Times New Roman, serif' font-style='italic' font-weight='600' font-size='70' fill='%2338bdf8'%3Et%3C/text%3E%3Cpath d='M63 18 v14 M56 25 h14' stroke='%2338bdf8' stroke-width='4.5' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --input-bg: #0f172a;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-dark: #0284c7;
      --indigo: #6366f1;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: #334155;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --success: #10b981;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; padding: 40px 20px 80px; }
    .container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }

    /* Exact match to in-app AppIconView */
    .app-icon-tile {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      border-radius: 17px;
      background-color: #16171a;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      user-select: none;
    }
    .app-icon-tile .icon-t {
      font-family: ui-serif, Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 55px;
      line-height: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8 0%, #0ea5e9 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      transform: translate(-3px, -1px);
    }
    .app-icon-tile .icon-plus {
      position: absolute;
      top: 12px;
      right: 14px;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8 0%, #0ea5e9 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    /* Exact match to in-app TallyWordmark */
    .wordmark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      font-family: ui-serif, Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 38px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .wordmark .wm-t { font-weight: 600; color: #38bdf8; }
    .wordmark .wm-A { font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; }
    .wordmark .wm-lly { font-weight: 600; color: #f8fafc; }
    .wordmark .wm-plus {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", sans-serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 0.55em;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #38bdf8 0%, #0284c7 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      transform: translateY(-0.55em);
      margin-left: 2px;
    }

    .tagline {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Segmented Tab Bar matching In-App LegalDocumentSheet */
    .segmented-control {
      display: inline-flex;
      background: #0b1120;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 4px;
      gap: 4px;
      margin: 22px auto 4px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .tab-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    .tab-btn:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .tab-btn.active {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      color: var(--text);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    section.doc-section {
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    section.doc-section.hidden {
      display: none;
    }

    .section-header {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .section-intro {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .card h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div class="app-icon-tile" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="icon-t">t</span>
        <span class="icon-plus">+</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="wordmark" aria-label="tAlly⁺">
          <span class="wm-t">t</span><span class="wm-A">A</span><span class="wm-lly">lly</span><span class="wm-plus">+</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="tagline">Your Private Health Ally</p>
      
      <div class="segmented-control" role="tablist" aria-label="Legal Documents">
        <button type="button" class="tab-btn active" data-tab="all" onclick="switchTab('all')">All Documents</button>
        <button type="button" class="tab-btn" data-tab="privacy" onclick="switchTab('privacy')">Privacy Policy</button>
        <button type="button" class="tab-btn" data-tab="terms" onclick="switchTab('terms')">Terms of Service</button>
        <button type="button" class="tab-btn" data-tab="medical" onclick="switchTab('medical')">Medical Notice</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 1. PRIVACY POLICY -->
    <section id="privacy" class="doc-section">
      <div class="section-header" style="color: var(--accent);">
        <span>✋ PRIVACY POLICY • LAST UPDATED OCTOBER 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Your intimate wellness data is yours alone. tAlly⁺ is built on a local-first philosophy with zero advertising, zero cross-app tracking, and no monetization of personal information.
      </p>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>1. Local-First Storage by Default</h3>
        <p>By default, all encounters, partner directories, STI screening records, test results, notes, and medication schedules are stored on your physical iPhone.</p>
        <p>We do not run background analytics, telemetry, or tracking servers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>2. Zero Advertising &amp; No Data Selling</h3>
        <p>tAlly⁺ contains zero third-party advertising SDKs and zero cross-app trackers.</p>
        <p>We never sell, broker, lease, or monetize your health, sexual activity, or identity data to any data broker, insurer, advertiser, or commercial entity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>3. Optional Cloud Backup (Google Firebase)</h3>
        <p>Cloud Backup is 100% optional. Only if you choose to sign in with Apple, Google, or Email, your records are uploaded to Google Firebase. Third-party sign-in providers (Apple and Google) and Google Firebase process data only to provide sign-in and backup.</p>
        <p>What is uploaded: your encounters, partners, test results (including attached lab-result images), medications, reminders, notes, and profile (including avatar photo), plus your account email, unique user ID, and sync timestamps.</p>
        <p>Backups are protected by HTTPS/TLS encryption in transit and Google's encryption at rest. They are not end-to-end encrypted.</p>
        <p>By signing in to Cloud Backup, you give your explicit consent to this upload of your health-related information. You can stop at any time by signing out or deleting your cloud account. Cloud data is deleted when you delete your account.</p>
        <p>Product Updates (Optional): If you opt in to product updates during account creation or in Account Settings, we may send occasional feature announcements or tips to your registered email. You can opt out at any time directly in Account Settings or via the unsubscribe link in any message.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>4. Device Hardware Permissions</h3>
        <p>Photo Library &amp; Camera: Used only when you choose to attach an avatar or a lab-result image. Photos are stored on your device. If you enable Cloud Backup, they are included in your backup.</p>
        <p>Face ID &amp; Touch ID: Used only for local on-device app unlock. Biometric data never leaves Apple's Secure Enclave.</p>
        <p>Local Notifications: Scheduled on your device for medication and screening reminders. If explicitly enabled in Settings, occasional product announcements may also be delivered. You can disable announcement alerts anytime in Notification Settings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>5. Your Rights &amp; Data Control</h3>
        <p>Export: generate a JSON export of your records anytime in Settings. It is not encrypted, so store it somewhere safe.</p>
        <p>Archived reminders: deleted reminders moved to Archived are retained locally for 30 days so you can restore them if needed, after which they are automatically and permanently deleted (or you can permanently delete them immediately at any time).</p>
        <p>Erase local data: 'Erase All Local Data' in Settings permanently wipes all local records, passcodes, and security questions from your device.</p>
        <p>Delete cloud account: permanently delete your cloud account and all synced backups in Settings &gt; Account &amp; Cloud Backup &gt; Delete Cloud Account.</p>
        <p>Under the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173) and, where applicable, equivalent laws in your country, you may have rights to access, correct, erase, and object to processing of your personal data, and to lodge a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (Philippines) or your local authority. Contact us to exercise these rights.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>6. Age Restriction &amp; Children</h3>
        <p>tAlly⁺ is for adults aged 18 and over. It is not directed to minors, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone under 18.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>7. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>We may update this policy. We will change the 'Last Updated' date and, for material changes, notify you in the app. Controller: tAlly⁺ Developer, Philippines.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. TERMS OF SERVICE -->
    <section id="terms" class="doc-section">
      <div class="section-header" style="color: var(--indigo);">
        <span>📄 TERMS OF SERVICE • LAST UPDATED OCTOBER 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Please read these Terms of Service carefully before using tAlly⁺. By downloading, installing, or using the application, you agree to be bound by these terms.
      </p>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>1. Acceptance, Age &amp; Apple EULA (18+)</h3>
        <p>By downloading or using tAlly⁺, you agree to these Terms and to Apple's Standard Licensed Application End User License Agreement (EULA).</p>
        <p>You must be at least 18 years old (or the age of majority where you live, if higher). By using the app, you affirm that you meet this requirement.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>2. Personal &amp; Non-Commercial License</h3>
        <p>We grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use tAlly⁺ on Apple devices you own or control, solely for personal self-tracking and wellness organization.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>3. Passcode Security &amp; Backup Responsibility</h3>
        <p>You are solely responsible for keeping your device passcode, app PIN, and recovery answers confidential.</p>
        <p>Because tAlly⁺ is local-first, you are responsible for maintaining backups using JSON export or optional Cloud Backup. We cannot recover data if you lose both your passcode and recovery answers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>4. Intellectual Property &amp; Acceptable Use</h3>
        <p>All visual assets, iconography, wordmarks, interface designs, and source code are the intellectual property of the developer.</p>
        <p>You may not reverse-engineer, decompile, redistribute, or reproduce the app without written permission. We may suspend or terminate access for misuse or violation of these Terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>5. Disclaimer &amp; Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, tAlly⁺ is provided 'as is' without warranties of any kind, and tAlly⁺ and its developers are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the app.</p>
        <p>Some jurisdictions do not allow certain exclusions or limits, so they may not apply to you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>6. Governing Law</h3>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the Philippines, and disputes will be brought before the proper courts of the Philippines, without depriving you of any mandatory consumer-protection rights in your country of residence.</p>
        <p>We may update these Terms and will change the 'Last Updated' date when we do.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. MEDICAL DISCLAIMER -->
    <section id="medical" class="doc-section">
      <div class="section-header" style="color: var(--danger);">
        <span>🩺 CRITICAL MEDICAL &amp; HEALTH DISCLAIMER</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Please read this medical notice thoroughly. tAlly⁺ is an organizational journal and does not provide clinical care or emergency services.
      </p>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>1. Not a Substitute for Medical Advice or Diagnosis</h3>
        <p>tAlly⁺ is a personal activity journal, screening reminder calendar, and medication course scheduler.</p>
        <p>tAlly⁺ is NOT a medical device, diagnostic instrument, clinical provider, or licensed medical professional.</p>
        <p>The countdowns, test cadences, and reminder tools in this app are for personal organizational reference only and do NOT constitute medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or clinical recommendations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>2. HIV 90-Day Window Period Tracker Notice</h3>
        <p>The 90-day exposure window assessment in tAlly⁺ applies strictly to statistical HIV exposure models and the 90-day conclusive window clearance period based on public health guidelines (CDC/WHO).</p>
        <p>It does NOT assess, detect, track, or guarantee clearance for other Sexually Transmitted Infections (STIs/STDs) such as Syphilis, Gonorrhea, Chlamydia, HPV, Herpes, or Hepatitis, which have distinct transmission routes, incubation periods, and testing guidelines.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>3. Always Consult Licensed Healthcare Providers</h3>
        <p>Always consult a licensed physician, STI clinic, or qualified medical professional with any questions regarding sexual health, screening intervals, symptoms, test interpretations, or clinical treatments.</p>
        <p>Never disregard or delay seeking professional clinical guidance because of something you have logged, calculated, or read in tAlly⁺.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>4. PrEP, PEP &amp; Doxy-PEP Medication Notice</h3>
        <p>Information and reminder presets for Pre-Exposure Prophylaxis (PrEP), Post-Exposure Prophylaxis (PEP), Doxycycline Post-Exposure Prophylaxis (Doxy-PEP), or antibiotics are scheduling aids only.</p>
        <p>Follow your prescribing physician's or dispensing pharmacist's instructions exactly regarding dosage, timing, and administration.</p>
        <p>Post-exposure prophylaxis (PEP) is time-critical. If you suspect an exposure to HIV or an STI, contact an emergency room or sexual health clinic immediately, without delay.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>5. Medical Emergencies</h3>
        <p>If you believe you are experiencing a medical emergency, acute infection, or severe reaction, immediately call your local emergency telephone number (911 in the US/Canada, 112 in the EU, 999 in the UK) or go to the nearest emergency hospital.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. CONTACT / SUPPORT -->
    <footer id="contact">
      <p><strong>Questions, Feedback or Inquiries?</strong></p>
      <p style="margin-top: 4px;">Direct Support: <a href="mailto:tallyplus.app@gmail.com">tallyplus.app@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px;">© 2026 tAlly⁺ Developer, Philippines. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>

  <script>
    function switchTab(tab) {
      var sections = ['privacy', 'terms', 'medical'];
      sections.forEach(function(id) {
        var el = document.getElementById(id);
        if (!el) return;
        if (tab === 'all' || tab === id) {
          el.classList.remove('hidden');
        } else {
          el.classList.add('hidden');
        }
      });

      var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
      buttons.forEach(function(btn) {
        if (btn.getAttribute('data-tab') === tab) {
          btn.classList.add('active');
        } else {
          btn.classList.remove('active');
        }
      });

      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
    }

    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
      var hash = window.location.hash.replace('#', '');
      if (['privacy', 'terms', 'medical'].indexOf(hash) !== -1) {
        switchTab(hash);
      }
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
